    ballRadius: this._toFinite(runtime.ballRadius, defaults.ballRadius),
  };
}
```

---

## SUMMARY OF KEY PATTERNS

| Aspect | Pattern |
|--------|---------|
| **Attachment to Rocket** | Read `attachTo: "rocket"` in options, call `ctx.getObject("rocket")` to get rocket's animationRoot, add gravityBalls root to it |
| **Position when Attached** | Use `offset` property (not `position`); position is used only when standalone |
| **Tween Apply** | Use `getTweenApplyMode(): "mergeAndSync"` → tweens merge into `_options`, then `syncFromOptions()` is called |
| **Animation Target** | Return `this.getTimelineRoot()` from `getAnimationTarget()` |
| **Disposal** | Dispose ALL geometries, materials, textures; remove from parent; clear arrays |
| **Layer Setup** | Call `root.traverse(child => child.layers.set(THREE_LAYER_ROCKET))` to set layer for all children |
| **Tweakable Props** | Listed in `TWEEKABLE_KEYS_BY_ID`, exposed to Theatre Studio, flow through `setTimelineVars()` |
| **Creation-Only Props** | Listed in `CREATION_ONLY_KEYS_BY_ID`, NOT tweakable, used at object creation |
| **Theatre Wiring** | Create `_applyGravityBalls()` handler in MainSceneRig that calls `obj.setTimelineVars()` with non-transform props |
